{"id":"768c760cb464c194","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-comb9-independent-matrix.md","title":"ZFC Comb9 Independent Matrix","display":"df-zfc-comb9-independent-matrix — ZFC Comb9 Independent Matrix","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb9-independent-matrix","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb9-independent-matrix"],"display":"df-zfc-comb9-independent-matrix — ZFC Comb9 Independent Matrix","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-finite-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb9-independent-matrix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb9-independent-matrix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb9-independent-matrix — ZFC Comb9 Independent Matrix"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"58-df-finite-subset\">58-df-finite-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J,M,F,\\varepsilon\\in V\">\\(I,J,M,F,\\varepsilon\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9IndependentMatrix}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9IndependentMatrix}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}independent\\text{-}matrix}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9IndependentMatrix}_S(M,I,J)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nM:I\\times J\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall F\\in[I\\times J]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon:F\\to2\\;\\Bigl|\n\\{n\\in\\omega:\\forall u\\in F\\;((\\varepsilon(u)=1\\to n\\in M(u))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15em}\\land(\\varepsilon(u)=0\\to n\\notin M(u)))\\}\n\\Bigr|=\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}independent\\text{-}matrix}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9IndependentMatrix}_S(M,I,J)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nM:I\\times J\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall F\\in[I\\times J]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon:F\\to2\\;\\Bigl|\n\\{n\\in\\omega:\\forall u\\in F\\;((\\varepsilon(u)=1\\to n\\in M(u))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15em}\\land(\\varepsilon(u)=0\\to n\\notin M(u)))\\}\n\\Bigr|=\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Boolean combinations are written as a bounded subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, so the empty <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> case evaluates unambiguously to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>. The unrelated generic “independent” atom is not used as a source.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"130f2eb9510d97cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,J,M,F,\\varepsilon\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9IndependentMatrix}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}independent\\text{-}matrix}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9IndependentMatrix}_S(M,I,J)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nM:I\\times J\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall F\\in[I\\times J]^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon:F\\to2\\;\\Bigl|\n\\{n\\in\\omega:\\forall u\\in F\\;((\\varepsilon(u)=1\\to n\\in M(u))\\\\\n&\\hspace{15em}\\land(\\varepsilon(u)=0\\to n\\notin M(u)))\\}\n\\Bigr|=\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1110,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1734","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-comb9-independent-matrix.md|58-df-zfc-comb9-independent-matrix]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","130f2eb9510d97cd"]}